// claim: a[2]$~ 99      the ONE update form. `a[2] = 99` does not exist, in any collection
// claim: result used   → builds, original untouched:  b = a[2]$~ 99
// claim: result thrown → modifies in place:            a[2]$~ 99
a = [1, 2, 3]
b = a[2]$~ 99
>> a " " b ¶          // → [1, 2, 3] [1, 99, 3]
a[2]$~ 99
>> a ¶                // → [1, 99, 3]
